    "notes": [
        "The initial full unit run is retained:639 suites and14386 tests passed,2 compiler suites could not find a compiler,1 Android helper timed out,68 tests skipped.",
        "The corrected pinned compiler was used for affected suites:both compiler suites passed,21 native tests; the same rerun had2 different Android5s timeouts.",
        "The unchanged-parent Android helper suite passed22 tests. The final isolated candidate Android helper suite passed22 tests at unchanged default5s timeout. Do not claim the baseline reproduced the failures.",
        "The final main/test TS and scoped ESLint pass. All-target dry build and pinned21.1.8 WASM reproduction passed; generated library binary matches manifest.",
        "The full3-corpus oracle passed all7613164 lexical rows/937 banks. It is fixed4-bank component correctness coverage with independent source inflate+CRC and JSON comparison, not a production planner/performance measurement.",
        "The tiny-loop key-only screen remains inconclusive for latency:JMdict median paired wall+1.2506%,Jitendex-7.7232%,ASCII+3.1709% with large tails. Do not claim whole-import speedup or a reliable small latency effect.",
        "parser-utf8-* files are rejected earlier width-dispatch variant observations and a setup failure; they are included as retained negative evidence and must not be attributed to the final tiny-loop candidate.",
        "Pinned compiler assembly confirms fused parse_and_encode_term_bank_token_binary_dedup calls standalone copy_valid_utf8. The nonfused build_term_string_plan inlines it. Unchanged fused main body size does not mean the changed helper is off the active path.",
        "Every copied receipt and archive member is byte-for-byte original. Replay scripts retain the original source/cache paths, which must exist or be intentionally rebound for a new run.",
        "Original failed or noisy attempts were not rewritten. The final isolated candidate Android result does not turn the original full-suite invocation into a pass.",
        "parser-utf8-vndb-parity.mjs is a retained earlier script with no completed rejected-variant result; the accepted candidate full3-corpus result is parser-loop-all-parity.json.",
        "Assembly provenance: pinned LLVM21.1.8 compiling candidate term-bank-parser.c with --target=wasm32-freestanding -O3 -matomics -mbulk-memory -msimd128 -nostdlib -S. This read-only call-path inspection was performed during correctness oracle work; oracle elapsed times are diagnostic only."
